{"seq":9,"slug":"urban-sociology","title":"城市社会学","stage":"DONE","category":"sociology","chapterCount":5,"docCount":16,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/sociology/urban-sociology","rating":{"composite":4.14,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4,"coverage":3.75,"positioning":5,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"城市社会学\">城市社会学</h1><p>约在 2008 年，人类越过一道历史门槛：全球城市人口首次超过乡村人口；据联合国《世界城市化展望》（2018 修订版），已有 55% 的人口居住在城市，并预测 2050 年升至 68%（<a href=\"https://www.un.org/development/desa/en/news/population/2018-revision-of-world-urbanization-prospects.html\">UN DESA, 2018</a>）。城市社会学，正是研究城市作为一种社会现象的学科——它不研究钢筋水泥本身，而研究城市这种密集、异质的聚居形态所孕育的社会关系、社会结构与生活方式。为什么城市里陌生人能和平共处却又彼此冷漠？为什么城市既是机遇与活力的中心，又是不平等与冲突的舞台？城市社会学把城市从单纯的物理空间，提升为理解现代社会的一把钥匙。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本-hub-讲什么-不讲什么-与兄弟-hub-的分工\">本 hub 讲什么、不讲什么（与兄弟 hub 的分工）</h2><p>城市社会学聚焦&quot;城市&quot;这一特定空间-社会形态，它与同属社会学（19_sociology）的兄弟 hub 既相关又分工明确：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>本 hub 关注<strong>城市作为社会现象</strong>——城市性、城市空间、社区与隔离、城市变迁。它的理论根基（齐美尔、芝加哥学派、列斐伏尔、卡斯特尔）来自 <a href=\"../sociological-theory/\">社会学理论</a>，尤其 <a href=\"../sociological-theory/critical-sociology/\">批判社会学</a>（哈维、卡斯特尔的批判城市理论在此展开）。</li>\n<li>城市的不平等（隔离、贫困集中、两极分化）是本 hub 的核心，但<strong>不平等本身的一般机制</strong>属于 <a href=\"../social-stratification/\">社会分层</a>——本 hub 讲不平等如何在&quot;空间&quot;上展开，社会分层 hub 讲阶层、贫困、种族不平等的一般原理；二者互补（见 <a href=\"../social-stratification/poverty-exclusion/\">贫困与排斥</a>、<a href=\"../social-stratification/racial-ethnic-inequality/\">种族-族裔不平等</a>）。</li>\n<li>郊区化、绅士化、全球城市等是城市的具体变迁，<strong>社会变迁的一般理论</strong>则属 <a href=\"../social-change/\">社会变迁</a>。</li>\n<li>城市的<strong>空间形态、地图、区位分析</strong>（同心圆、扇形、GIS）与 <a href=\"../../geography-geopolitics/urban-geography/\">城市地理学</a> 部分重叠——本 hub 关注空间的<strong>社会逻辑</strong>（空间即社会），城市地理学关注空间的<strong>形态与分布规律</strong>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>一句话：本 hub 的独特视角是&quot;把城市视为映射并再生产社会的镜子&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"推荐学习路径与前置\">推荐学习路径与前置</h2><p>无需社会学背景即可阅读。若读过 <a href=\"../sociological-theory/\">社会学理论</a> 的古典理论（齐美尔、滕尼斯）会更顺，但非必需——本系列会就地交代关键人物与概念。建议按章顺序阅读，五章层层递进：先立&quot;视角&quot;（第一章），再看&quot;生活&quot;（第二章），继而剖&quot;空间&quot;（第三章），然后察&quot;社会&quot;（第四章），最后观&quot;变迁&quot;并收束于&quot;意义&quot;（第五章）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[第一章 基础: 把城市视为社会现象] --&gt; B[第二章 城市性与都市生活: 自由与疏离]&#10;  B --&gt; C[第三章 空间与结构: 空间即社会]&#10;  C --&gt; D[第四章 社区与隔离: 联结与分裂]&#10;  D --&gt; E[第五章 变迁与意义: 城市权利]&#10;  A -.前置可选.-&gt; F[社会学理论 古典理论]&#10;  D -.互补.-&gt; G[社会分层 贫困/种族不平等]\">flowchart TD\n  A[第一章 基础: 把城市视为社会现象] --&gt; B[第二章 城市性与都市生活: 自由与疏离]\n  B --&gt; C[第三章 空间与结构: 空间即社会]\n  C --&gt; D[第四章 社区与隔离: 联结与分裂]\n  D --&gt; E[第五章 变迁与意义: 城市权利]\n  A -.前置可选.-&gt; F[社会学理论 古典理论]\n  D -.互补.-&gt; G[社会分层 贫困/种族不平等]</pre><h2 id=\"五章地图\">五章地图</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>章</th>\n<th>主题</th>\n<th>核心人物 / 概念</th>\n<th>关键篇</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>一</td>\n<td>城市社会学基础</td>\n<td>沃斯的定义、规模/密度/异质性、城市化（UN 数据）</td>\n<td><a href=\"foundations/what-is-urban-sociology\">什么是城市社会学</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>二</td>\n<td>城市性与都市生活</td>\n<td>沃斯城市性、齐美尔都市心态、自由与疏离</td>\n<td><a href=\"urbanism-and-life/urbanism-as-life\">城市性</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>三</td>\n<td>城市空间与社会结构</td>\n<td>芝加哥学派、空间分异（红线）、空间即社会（列斐伏尔）</td>\n<td><a href=\"space-and-structure/space-is-social\">空间即社会</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>四</td>\n<td>社区与隔离</td>\n<td>甘斯城市村庄、梅西丹顿超级隔离、威尔逊邻里效应</td>\n<td><a href=\"community-and-segregation/consequences\">隔离的后果</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>五</td>\n<td>城市变迁与意义</td>\n<td>郊区化、绅士化（格拉斯/史密斯）、全球城市（萨森）、城市权利</td>\n<td><a href=\"change-and-significance/significance\">当代意义</a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>第一章<strong>城市社会学基础</strong>界定这门学科把城市视为社会现象（而非物理空间）的独特视角、城市&quot;规模-密度-异质性&quot;的本质特征（沃斯 1938），以及城市化这一宏大变革。第二章<strong>城市性与都市生活</strong>考察城市特有的生活方式（沃斯的&quot;城市性&quot;）、齐美尔笔下的都市心态（矜持、漠然），以及自由与疏离的双重性。第三章<strong>城市空间与社会结构</strong>从芝加哥学派出发，揭示空间分异背后的社会逻辑（地价、红线、权力）与&quot;空间即社会&quot;的洞见（列斐伏尔）。第四章<strong>社区与隔离</strong>考察人们如何在城市中寻求联结（甘斯的城市村庄），以及城市如何把群体分隔（梅西、丹顿的隔离研究、威尔逊的邻里效应）。第五章<strong>城市变迁与意义</strong>考察郊区化、绅士化（格拉斯造词）、全球城市与超级都市（萨森），并以列斐伏尔的&quot;城市权利&quot;收束。</p>\n<p>读完本知识库，你将获得一把理解城市与现代社会的钥匙：既能看懂一座城市的空间格局背后的社会逻辑，也能对城市的不平等、隔离、变迁与未来多一分批判性的洞察。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"城市社会学基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/sociology/urban-sociology/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"what-is-urban-sociology","title":"什么是城市社会学","url":"/l-doc-books/h/sociology/urban-sociology/foundations/what-is-urban-sociology"},{"seq":2,"slug":"city-as-social-phenomenon","title":"城市作为社会现象的视角","url":"/l-doc-books/h/sociology/urban-sociology/foundations/city-as-social-phenomenon"},{"seq":3,"slug":"urbanization","title":"城市化与规模、密度、异质性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/sociology/urban-sociology/foundations/urbanization"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"urbanism-and-life","title":"城市性与都市生活","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/sociology/urban-sociology/urbanism-and-life","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"urbanism-as-life","title":"城市性：作为一种生活方式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/sociology/urban-sociology/urbanism-and-life/urbanism-as-life"},{"seq":2,"slug":"stranger-and-mentality","title":"陌生人社会与都市心态","url":"/l-doc-books/h/sociology/urban-sociology/urbanism-and-life/stranger-and-mentality"},{"seq":3,"slug":"freedom-and-isolation","title":"自由与疏离","url":"/l-doc-books/h/sociology/urban-sociology/urbanism-and-life/freedom-and-isolation"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"space-and-structure","title":"城市空间与社会结构","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/sociology/urban-sociology/space-and-structure","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"chicago-school","title":"芝加哥学派与城市生态学","url":"/l-doc-books/h/sociology/urban-sociology/space-and-structure/chicago-school"},{"seq":2,"slug":"spatial-differentiation","title":"空间分异与社会逻辑","url":"/l-doc-books/h/sociology/urban-sociology/space-and-structure/spatial-differentiation"},{"seq":3,"slug":"space-is-social","title":"空间即社会","url":"/l-doc-books/h/sociology/urban-sociology/space-and-structure/space-is-social"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"community-and-segregation","title":"社区与隔离","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/sociology/urban-sociology/community-and-segregation","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"community-in-the-city","title":"城市中的社区","url":"/l-doc-books/h/sociology/urban-sociology/community-and-segregation/community-in-the-city"},{"seq":2,"slug":"segregation","title":"隔离","url":"/l-doc-books/h/sociology/urban-sociology/community-and-segregation/segregation"},{"seq":3,"slug":"consequences","title":"隔离的后果与社会不平等","url":"/l-doc-books/h/sociology/urban-sociology/community-and-segregation/consequences"}]},{"seq":5,"slug":"change-and-significance","title":"城市变迁与意义","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/sociology/urban-sociology/change-and-significance","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"suburbanization","title":"郊区化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/sociology/urban-sociology/change-and-significance/suburbanization"},{"seq":2,"slug":"gentrification-and-renewal","title":"绅士化与城市更新","url":"/l-doc-books/h/sociology/urban-sociology/change-and-significance/gentrification-and-renewal"},{"seq":3,"slug":"global-cities","title":"全球城市与超级都市","url":"/l-doc-books/h/sociology/urban-sociology/change-and-significance/global-cities"},{"seq":4,"slug":"significance","title":"城市社会学的当代意义与未来","url":"/l-doc-books/h/sociology/urban-sociology/change-and-significance/significance"}]}]}